    "title": "12月信息更新",
    "category": 1,
    "header": "",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong>·12月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"314\" title=\"1 封面.png\" alt=\"1 封面.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20251029/4bd40d5adad286d224b43ca527b34d0e.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"background-color:#1f1f1f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·游览者列表</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"315\" title=\"2 月度.png\" alt=\"2 月度.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20251029/e3fde5a51616ca33093e4b681b900c11.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">界园游客 黍</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">她随春荣冬枯，感受生命。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·游园纪念</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"323\" title=\"月更新.png\" alt=\"月更新.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20251128/c6350ce5b199624340cf50b5ec366c79.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">游园纪念添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">游园纪念的等级上限提升至</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">125</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">12月稀有奖励 可交互家具 “入境”</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"> 一张玉桌，一块石屏，加上若干摆件，拼成了这套岁兽代理人的赠礼。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">易为这套馈赠做了特殊处理，石屏上会呈现岁兽残识之境，但不会沾染半点岁气，不用担心物品成伥到处捣乱。</span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">12月稀有奖励 老鲤形象时装</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">手中把玩的是一件件藏品，眼中流转的是生死浮沉。宝物若能言语，又将向他诉说何种故事？</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·本月委托栏</span></strong></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
